1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Five hundred years ago, Bosch painted a garden overflowing with pleasure.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,050
You are looking at the same place through another possibility.

3
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:09,492
Is this a punishment, or a consequence we prefer not to see?

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,148
The garden returns. What you have seen remains part of it, even when it disappears.
